  "title": "What Are the Dimensions of Popular Storage Unit Sizes in Minneapolis?",
  "summary": "Popular storage unit sizes in Minneapolis include 5&#215;5, 7&#215;10, 5&#215;15, 10&#215;10, 10&#215;15, 10&#215;20, 10&#215;25, and 10&#215;30. These sizes range from about 25 square feet of floor space for 5&#215;5 units to about 300 square feet for a 10&#215;30 unit. For people living in Minneapolis, the size of the storage unit you need usually depends on your location and purpose. [...]",
